                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg372">Note to Great Britain of December 26,
                                            protesting against seizures and detentions regarded as
                                            unwarranted</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg383">Special cases: The <hi
                                                rendition="#italic">Sturmfels, Birkenfels, and
                                                Schneefels</hi>
                                        </ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg387">Embargoes and related restrictions on trade by
