                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg535">Censorship of the mails by belligerent
                                    governments: diplomatic and consular mail</ref>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>Part III: <hi rendition="#small-caps">Neutral Duties</hi>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg547">Proclamations of neutrality—The President’s
                                    appeal to the people of the United States</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg556">Enlistments in belligerent forces—The problem
                                    of reservists</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg564">The transit of reservists from Canada across
