                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg570">The sale and transportation of contraband
                                    goods</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg580">Loans to belligerent governments</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg583">Treatment of belligerent warships, their crews
